  "control_questions_note": "ctrl_* entries are unanswerable from this corpus by construction. They measure refusal precision: the engine must decline them. Answering one is a hallucination, and is a worse failure than refusing an answerable query.",
  "fact_matching_note": "An entry may be a list of equivalent surface forms; any one counts. This keeps the set measuring grounding rather than phrasing \u2014 an answer saying 'thirty-six months' should not lose recall for not writing '36 months'. Interpretive adjectives ('improved', 'deleveraged') were removed: they test word choice, not whether the figure was retrieved."
}